{"message":"For a personal checking account, I recommend the Bluest Account. It charges $0 for foreign ATM withdrawals and automatically rebates foreign ATM operator fees up to $50 per monthly statement cycle, so it is the lowest-cost option among the personal accounts documented here. ATM operators may still charge fees above the rebate limit, and exchange-rate or dynamic-currency-conversion charges can still apply.

The Green Fee-Free Account also has $0 foreign ATM fees, but it may charge a $22.50 monthly maintenance fee unless you maintain a $150 minimum daily balance, and its terms do not include the same foreign-operator-fee rebate. Bluest is therefore the better fit for your trip based on ATM costs.

